manga-honyaku

Portions of this software are derived from MangaTranslator
(https://github.com/meangrinch/MangaTranslator), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Derived files carry a note in their module docstring. The detection stage
follows that project's RT-DETR adapter and model manager; the YOLO paths, and
with them the AGPL-3.0 `ultralytics` dependency, are not carried over.

Model weights are not distributed with this repository. Both are Apache-2.0 and
are downloaded on first run: `ogkalu/comic-text-and-bubble-detector` for
detection, and `kha-white/manga-ocr-base` for reading the Japanese.
